      color: rgba(13, 27, 34, 0.66);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ─── Spec strip — Capital · Operations · Revenue · Term.
           Same four axes for every model so the row reads as
           a comparable spec sheet. Soft contained gray-grid
           look — distinct from the surrounding card body, but
           refined: subtle bg gradient on the cells, hairline
           outer border, inner 1px hairline cell separators.

           dd uses white-space: pre-line so the JS can pass an
