              <span class="text-white/70 text-sm">24/7 monitoring across every connected charger</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-evium-green flex-shrink-0"></div>
              <span class="text-white/70 text-sm">Automatic fault detection with remote restart and diagnostics</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-evium-green flex-shrink-0"></div>
              <span class="text-white/70 text-sm">Certified field technicians dispatched for hardware faults</span>
